    "Book title is the source metadata Text field; the metadata has no Language field.",
    "The README says the lyrics are \"in isiZulu and Ndebele languages\". A book carries one tag, so the text was checked for markers that differ between isiZulu and Northern Ndebele: Zulu comitative forms nami/nawe/naye/nathi/nani occur 124 times against 1 Ndebele la- form (lawe/laye/lathi/lani); Zulu manje (\"now\") occurs 54 times and Ndebele khathesi 0; Zulu second-person plural nina occurs 6 times and Ndebele lina 0. The text follows isiZulu grammar, so the tag is zu (ISO 639-1); isiNdebele use is acknowledged in the coverage note."
